  epo:definesSpecificPlaceOfPerformance <http://data.europa.eu/a4g/resource/058f55a1-4424-4ec3-a649-460e7891a311-01/ContractLocation$_PriorInformationNotice1_ProcurementProjectLot1_ProcurementProject1_RealizedLocation1_Address1> .

